      "updated": 1790625924150,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "zone.js\n\"Monkey Patched\" browser APIs\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "zone.js\n\"Monkey Patched\" browser APIs\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "We6cN1fibHKcOqW1RF3QV",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 933,
      "y": 2159,
      "width": 475.4796142578125,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aY",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 871326693,
      "version": 195,
      "versionNonce": 1722578597,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790626015340,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "const realSetInterval = window.setInterval;\n\nwindow.setInterval = (fn, time) => {\n  realSetInterval(fn)\n  changeDetection(); // trigger change detection\n}, time);",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "const realSetInterval = window.setInterval;\n\nwindow.setInterval = (fn, time) => {\n  realSetInterval(fn)\n  changeDetection(); // trigger change detection\n}, time);",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "1_VjzoOneN4JA6dUh5_N4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 933,
      "y": 2406,
      "width": 668.5595703125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aZ",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 868272235,
      "version": 162,
      "versionNonce": 1811736331,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790626103159,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "signals -\n    these are awesome.\n    all component state* should be in signals now.\n\nThese set up a relationship between a value and a dom element, etc.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "signals -\n    these are awesome.\n    all component state* should be in signals now.\n\nThese set up a relationship between a value and a dom element, etc.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "JHwEgK-8lURfqZ-1sSoGu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 792,
      "y": 2804,
      "width": 869,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aa",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 187259205,
      "version": 568,
      "versionNonce": 1142094213,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790627219662,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "HTML-\n\n\n<h1 style=\"color: red;\">Boo!</h1>\n\n\n<button disabled>Can't Click Me</button>\n\nEvery HTML element from the W3C is a component.\n\n\n\nInputs are the ability to pass a value to a component.\n    Just appear as attributes. \n    However if the value you are setting needs evaluation, use square brackets.\n\nOutputs are a way for a component to tell the 'parent' something happened.\n    These are *always* with parens.\n    <button (click)=\"doIt()\">Click Me for a Good Time</button>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "HTML-\n\n\n<h1 style=\"color: red;\">Boo!</h1>\n\n\n<button disabled>Can't Click Me</button>\n\nEvery HTML element from the W3C is a component.\n\n\n\nInputs are the ability to pass a value to a component.\n    Just appear as attributes. \n    However if the value you are setting needs evaluation, use square brackets.\n\nOutputs are a way for a component to tell the 'parent' something happened.\n    These are *always* with parens.\n    <button (click)=\"doIt()\">Click Me for a Good Time</button>",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
